<FBType Name="SK_MoveNeedleDown" Comment="Skill primitive MoveNeedleDown: Needle down to the bottom end switch (parameters: none). OPC UA Start(Session, parameters...)/Stop/Abort/Reset(Session) -&gt; [Accepted, ErrorID]; START/HALT/ABORT/RESET from a parent -&gt; SUCCESS or FAILURE(ErrorID)">
